                "allownull": true,
                "type": "int"
            },
            "conditions_json": {
                "class": "core_external\\external_value",
                "desc": "JSON array of conditions (empty array removes all conditions). Each entry is an object with \"type\": \"completion\" (fields \"activity_cmid\", \"status\": complete|incomplete|pass|fail), \"date\" (fields \"direction\": from|until, \"timestamp\": Unix time) or \"group\" (field \"group_id\", 0 or omitted = any group). All entries must be satisfied at the same time (AND).",
